# Vivarium Store — Site Improvement Checklist

## Agent Instructions
- Implement **one step at a time**, in order.
- After finishing each step: summarize what was changed, commit & push, then **stop and ask the user to confirm** before moving on.
- Never skip a step or batch multiple steps together unless the user explicitly asks.
- Mark each step `✅ Done` in this file once confirmed by the user.

